│ These modifications change the error         │
│ handling within the linkcheck function to    │
│ correctly report HTTP errors, specifically   │
│ 404s, instead of falsely reporting an        │
│ "Anchor not found" error. The                │
│ ClientResponseError is used to provide a     │
│ more informative error message including the │
│ HTTP status code. The changes also ensure    │
│ that the linkcheck continues to return False │
│ if the status code is an error.              │
